sequenceDiagram
    participant CPU
    participant MMU as Memory Management Unit
    participant Kernel
    participant Disk
    
    CPU->>MMU: Access address 0x12345000
    MMU->>MMU: Look up page table entry
    alt Page present in RAM
        MMU->>CPU: Return physical address
        Note over CPU: Access succeeds
    else Page not present (minor fault)
        MMU->>Kernel: Page Fault Exception
        Note over Kernel: Page in memory but not mapped
        Kernel->>Kernel: Update page table
        Kernel-->>CPU: Resume execution
        CPU->>MMU: Retry access
        MMU->>CPU: Return physical address
    else Page swapped out (major fault)
        MMU->>Kernel: Page Fault Exception
        Kernel->>Disk: Read page from swap
        Disk-->>Kernel: Page data
        Kernel->>Kernel: Allocate physical frame
        Kernel->>Kernel: Update page table
        Kernel-->>CPU: Resume execution
        CPU->>MMU: Retry access
        MMU->>CPU: Return physical address
    else Invalid access (segmentation fault)
        MMU->>Kernel: Page Fault Exception
        Kernel->>Kernel: Check permissions
        Kernel->>CPU: Send SIGSEGV signal
        Note over CPU: Process terminated
    end
